</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 724)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Compare keeps each clip&#8217;s own shape.</b> Comparing two spots with different aspect ratios stretched the second to match the first. B now keeps its own aspect in every compare mode &#8212; side by side, stacked, wipe, mix and difference &#8212; and in frame grabs and reports.</li>
<li><b>Camera raw is named.</b> An ARRIRAW <code>.mxf</code> now says what it is and what to develop it to, instead of &#8220;Cannot Open&#8221;.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
